==Strategy==
This stage is not difficult if you know what you are doing. [[Figure Skating Cats (Super Rare Cat)|Slapsticks]], [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]], [[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Jelly Dumpling Cat]], [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Ramen Cat]], [[Food Stall Cat (Rare Cat)|Cafeteria Cat]], [[Elder Mask Doron (Special Cat)|Doron]], and [[Elder Beast Naala (Special Cat)|Naala]] are good units to bring here. Other Weaken, slow and surge immune units work as well.

A generally good idea is to stall out the 7 Dorons while chipping the boss, Sunfish Jones, down little by little. Make sure to dispose of the two Othoms quickly to make sure they don't wreak havoc on your forces. Ramen with a couple research [[Cat Combo|combos]] can work here as your solo meatshield, preferably with curse resist. Once the 7 Dorons are all gone, the stage is a cakewalk.

